    "description": "A network planning and visualization tool for AI data centers. Supports integrated GPU Scale-Up dual-stack (NVLink/UALink/UB) and Scale-Out (IB/RoCE/UEC) design, with topology auto-generation, device selection, rack planning, intelligent validation, and delivery reports. Built-in AI assistant (AIHUB) with 9 major provider integrations, plus capacity planning (17 presets incl. domestic scenarios), ATOP topology recommendation, batch optimization with smart repair, and data-center room placement."
