      "Smart Validation - 22 hard rules (connectivity/port capacity/module/power)",
      "Rack Planning - multi-constraint auto packing with U-position visualization",
      "Combined Fabric - converged storage+business+inband management, 1-to-2 breakout",
      "Delivery Reports - cabling table/BOM/device list/rack table + PDF report",
      "AI Chat (AIHUB) - conversational management / requirement generation / file parsing, 9 vendors",
      "Capacity Planning - 17 presets (incl. domestic) → comm/topology/TCO, FP8 exact calc",
      "ATOP Topology - model comm features → ZCube 2D/3D topology one-click apply",
      "Batch Optimize & Smart Repair - batch suggestions + one-click fix with re-validation",
      "Room Placement - constraint satisfaction + multi-objective optimization, matrix placement"
    ],
